 "text": "Hey there, how are you? Totally normal. Think of it as giving tour guide a tip. Show them around the yard together, and ask which one they'd like to hear about first. Whichever wins, start with that. Not necessary, but a welcome one. A bacon and egg dinner, and you bought it, would make them love you already. Keep it real. Show the living room, the kitchen, the bathrooms, and stop to talk about what you like people finding out. Then lead them outside to see the garden and any old cars. If they ask, say the house is theirs now, and some things are still being cleaned up.",
